        laws that apply to you. You are also responsible for maintaining your device and
        reviewing app permissions before granting them.
      </p>
      <h2>5. User Files and Content</h2>
      <p>
        You retain responsibility for files and content you choose to use with an app, including
        ensuring you have the right to use them. App-specific information explains how a
        particular app handles selected content.
      </p>
      <h2>6. Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Some apps may show advertising; others may not. Advertising behavior and any available
        ad-free option depend on the individual app and its current version.
      </p>
      <h2>7. Purchases and Google Play Billing</h2>
      <p>
        Some apps may offer optional purchases or premium products. Where purchases are offered,
        they are made through Google Play and may also be subject to Google Play’s applicable
        payment terms and conditions. Availability and purchase features vary by app.
      </p>
      <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Apps or website features may rely on third-party services. Your use of those services
        may also be governed by the third party’s terms and policies.
      </p>
      <h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The website and its content, branding, and app materials are owned by Paul Digital or
        used with permission, and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. These
        terms do not transfer ownership to you. Third-party components remain subject to their
        own license terms.
      </p>
      <h2>10. Availability and Service Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may maintain, update, change, suspend, or discontinue parts of the website or an app
        as needed. Where applicable, app updates and availability are also subject to Google
        Play.
      </p>
      <h2>11. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>
        The website and apps are provided on an “as available” basis. Information about
        individual apps and features is provided for that app and may change. Nothing in these
        terms excludes rights or guarantees that cannot be excluded under applicable law.
      </p>
      <h2>12. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by applicable law, Paul Digital is not liable for indirect or
        consequential loss arising from use of the website or apps. These terms do not limit
        liability that cannot legally be limited.
      </p>
      <h2>13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated when the website, apps, or applicable requirements change.
        The current version will be available on this page. Continued use after an update means
        you accept the updated terms, to the extent permitted by law.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about these Terms of Use, contact Paul Digital at
        <a href="mailto:askpaulonline@gmail.com">askpaulonline@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
